  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be a vector such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If the minimum value of the scalar triple product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> are coprime natural numbers, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3501",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>min</mi><mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>w</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3401</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>34</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3400</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>)</p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>3401</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mn>3401</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3501</mn></math></p>",
